@startuml componentes-biblioteca - en
left to right direction
'skinparam componentStyle rectangle
'skinparam linetype ortho

component "Identity &\nAccess (IAM/RBAC)" as IAM
component "Profile\nManagement" as Perfis
component "Room\nManagement" as Salas
component "Equipment\nManagement" as Equip
component "Scheduling &\nAvailability Engine" as Agendamento
component "Reservations" as Reservas
component "Notifications" as Notificacoes
component "Observability\n(Logs & Monitoring)" as Observabilidade
component "Backup &\nRecovery" as Backup

' --- Autorização/autenticação (cross-cutting) ---
Perfis --> IAM : <<Authorizes>>
Salas --> IAM : <<Authorizes>>
Equip --> IAM : <<Authorizes>>
Reservas --> IAM : <<Authorizes>>

' --- Disponibilidade usa dados de recursos ---
Agendamento --> Salas : <<Consults attributes/capacity>>
Agendamento --> Equip : <<Considers constraints>>

' --- Reservas verifica disponibilidade e referencia recursos ---
Reservas --> Agendamento : <<Checks availability>>
Reservas ..> Salas : <<Listens for blocking/change events>>
Reservas ..> Equip : <<Listens for blocking/change events>>

' --- Notificações de reserva ---
Reservas --> Notificacoes : <<Send e-mails>>

' --- Observabilidade (logs/monitoramento) ---
IAM --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>
Perfis --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>
Salas --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>
Equip --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>
Agendamento --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>
Reservas --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>
Notificacoes --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>
Backup --> Observabilidade : <<Emits logs>>

' --- Backups periódicos de dados ---
Backup ..> Perfis : <<Backs up data>>
Backup ..> Salas : <<Backs up data>>
Backup ..> Equip : <<Backs up data>>
Backup ..> Reservas : <<Backs up data>>

@enduml
